---
source: crates/efr-cli/src/cli/tests.rs
expression: "Cli::command().render_help().to_string()"
---
Talk to the efr daemon: send prompts, follow replies, check status

Usage: efr <COMMAND>

Commands:
  send  Send a prompt to this terminal's conversation and follow the reply
  new   Start a new conversation for this terminal, optionally with a first prompt
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

In zsh, the efr plugin runs these for you: `, <prompt>`, `,new` and `,! <text>`.
